{
  "case_id": "CA-PILOT-005",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact_id": "F01",
      "text": "A于2006年5月24日星期三出狱假释，乘火车返回马德拉，在朋友家过第一夜；因朋友要搬家，只能住一夜。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0014"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0014"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "reported_event",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F02",
      "text": "A在5月25日接受初次假释访谈。B在接收表上标记“Yes”并圈出“PC 290”，注记“To register, 290 PC by 5-31-06”；B作证说这表示她亲自告知A须在五日内登记，并让他5月26日见指定假释官C。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0015",
        "P0017"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0015",
        "CL-O2256789-P0017"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "attributed_testimony",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_INTAKE_AGENT",
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F03",
      "text": "A于5月25日星期四夜间住在马德拉救助站。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0018"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0018"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "reported_event",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F04",
      "text": "5月26日，A告诉C自己住在救助站。C要求其登记，并在假释档案中记载须在5月31日前登记；C说救助站离学校太近，A不能继续住在那里。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0019"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0019"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "reported_interaction",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_ASSIGNED_AGENT",
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F05",
      "text": "C安排A住在马德拉县境内一间汽车旅馆，把A及另一名假释人员送去，并要求两人向县警长部门登记。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0020"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0020"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "reported_interaction",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_ASSIGNED_AGENT",
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F06",
      "text": "A于5月26日星期五夜间住在该汽车旅馆。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0020"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0020"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "reported_event",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F07",
      "text": "C在安置A后的五日内进行强制家访，发现A不在指定房间，个人物品也已带走；C另一天再去，A仍不在。两个家访的具体日期未记载。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0021"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0021"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "reported_observation",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_ASSIGNED_AGENT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F08",
      "text": "A于5月27日星期六搬到马德拉市内一名堂表亲家中，并在那里待到6月3日星期六被捕。原文未给出亲属姓名和地址。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0022"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0022"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "reported_event",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F09",
      "text": "A作证解释搬走是因为有人到旅馆房间绑架、威胁他；他逃脱后仍害怕。这是A的说法，来源没有独立确认绑架、威胁的真实性或详情。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0022"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0022"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "contested_defendant_account",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F10",
      "text": "原文记载A未尝试联系C，也未登记；此前5月26日见C时尚未向警察或县警长登记。登记机关的原始查询记录未附。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0019",
        "P0022"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0019",
        "CL-O2256789-P0022"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "reported_nonregistration",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F11",
      "text": "A作证说，5月26日见C之前，他曾到马德拉警察部门尝试登记，但因没有预约和身份证明被拒。这是A的转述，没有接待人员证词或窗口记录。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0024"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0024"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "contested_defendant_account",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F12",
      "text": "A在证言中承认知道登记要求。原文另记载有人提出他以往因未遵守登记要求而违反假释的证据，但未提供每次的具体资料。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0025"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0025"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "attributed_admission_and_history",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F13",
      "text": "A作证说，大部分人生住在马德拉，家人在当地；此前多次假释出狱后也返回当地。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0024"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0024"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "attributed_testimony",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F14",
      "text": "原文记载，从出狱次日算到被捕，A已在马德拉十日，经过六个完整工作日：5月25、26日及5月30日至6月2日。5月29日星期一为阵亡将士纪念日假日。法律期限的起算和迁居影响仍须论证。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0022"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0022"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "source_calendar_count",
      "known_by_role_ids": [],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F15",
      "text": "原始起诉书引文指控A于2006年6月3日前后在马德拉县故意违反旧版Penal Code §290(a)(1)(A)登记义务；原文只列一项本案实体指控。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0032"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0032"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "charging_record",
      "known_by_role_ids": [],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F16",
      "text": "A的登记义务背景为既往性犯罪定罪；原文记载其因马德拉县共同实施强奸定罪服刑后假释，并在本人证言中提到1990年强奸及入室盗窃定罪。没有补入既往犯罪的具体情节。",
      "source_id": "source15",
      "source_paragraph_ids": [
        "P0014",
        "P0024"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        "CL-O2256789-P0014",
        "CL-O2256789-P0024"
      ],
      "epistemic_status": "registration_predicate_history",
      "known_by_role_ids": [
        "R_DEFENDANT"
      ],
      "is_synthetic_fact": false,
      "record_limit_method": null
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F17",
      "text": "来源未附接收表、假释档案、登记机关查询、预约或身份证件原件；也未附旅馆相关事件的独立记录。不能补写这些文件或把“未附”改成“原案不存在”。",
